  (text "PMODE = GND: modo PH/EN (EN = PWM, PH = sentido), como o DIR/PWM do IFX9201." (at 282.0 156.21 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid 7cbc0ad9-a232-4656-9ad2-e17d4d872b19)
  )
  (text "IMODE = GND: corte por tempo fixo e religamento automatico (nunca trava a saida na corrida)." (at 282.0 158.75 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid dff81514-d222-4d59-95e5-3d1d2cbbe572)
  )
  (text "ITRIP = VREF / (450 uA/A x R_IPROPI) = 2,0 V / (450 uA/A x 1,5 k) = ~3,0 A." (at 282.0 161.29000000000002 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid 77044199-4146-4cf0-b4c9-b1e8eac967af)
  )
  (text "Ajuste: troque R13/R14 (VREF ate 3,6 V) ou R11/R12. nFAULT sem uso." (at 282.0 163.83 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid 3a072f2d-28a5-423d-a00d-cbda41bf02d9)
  )
  (text "PH = 0 -> OUT2 positivo (o firmware usa D3/D4 = 0 para frente)." (at 282.0 166.37 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid 61ce8eb7-4df2-4671-9d77-5dcffbf78fcd)
